In fact,


01:32:38.876 --> 01:32:43.417
his teammates wish
to say goodbye.


01:32:51.501 --> 01:32:53.626
This isn't the right
moment to say it,


01:32:53.792 --> 01:32:56.501
but the Fed invite to
the Championships is yours.


01:32:57.042 --> 01:32:59.501
I suggested it,
after what happened,


01:32:59.667 --> 01:33:01.667
and the Minister approved.


01:33:18.834 --> 01:33:19.751
Jean...


01:33:22.084 --> 01:33:24.084
This is the second time
we say goodbye.


01:33:26.709 --> 01:33:28.417
I thought I was ready, but...


01:33:30.959 --> 01:33:32.876
The first time was
18 months ago,


01:33:33.959 --> 01:33:36.376
just after his diagnosis
of bone cancer.


01:33:38.376 --> 01:33:41.917
He invited us to a party
with a cake saying:


01:33:43.542 --> 01:33:44.917
"Happy Cancer".


01:33:50.709 --> 01:33:53.459
Jean loved dumb jokes.


01:33:57.376 --> 01:34:01.417
Like when he switched
Xavier's phone numbers.


01:34:02.376 --> 01:34:03.959
Xavier's grandmother


01:34:04.126 --> 01:34:07.501
got a message
intended for his lover.


01:34:12.667 --> 01:34:15.417
We laughed less
as he had more chemo.


01:34:18.334 --> 01:34:20.084
One morning I woke,


01:34:22.667 --> 01:34:23.834
he said to me...


01:34:24.959 --> 01:34:26.251
you deserve better.


01:34:28.542 --> 01:34:30.251
And he disappeared.


01:34:33.959 --> 01:34:35.626
I really hated you for that.


01:34:37.917 --> 01:34:39.334
Then I understood that,


01:34:40.292 --> 01:34:41.584
your extreme freedom


01:34:42.459 --> 01:34:43.917
was your way of fighting,


01:34:45.209 --> 01:34:46.792
of hiding the pain.


01:34:49.126 --> 01:34:51.626
Like building this team,
the Shiny Shrimps.


01:34:53.667 --> 01:34:56.209
To show your Dad that
homos can play water-polo.


01:34:59.542 --> 01:35:00.501
Jean...


01:35:01.251 --> 01:35:02.542
Love of my life.


01:35:05.001 --> 01:35:06.917
You would have
hated your funeral.


01:35:08.626 --> 01:35:10.042
All in black,


01:35:10.876 --> 01:35:12.251
all so sad.


01:35:17.751 --> 01:35:19.834
I hope you're watching.


01:35:21.001 --> 01:35:22.376
Because this is for you.


01:35:24.584 --> 01:35:25.501
Friends...


01:35:37.584 --> 01:35:39.792
- What are they doing?
- I don't know.


01:37:20.501 --> 01:37:22.417
These people have
no respect, huh?


01:37:23.959 --> 01:37:24.876
Fuck off.


01:37:25.626 --> 01:37:27.584
Hey that's not on!


01:37:29.126 --> 01:37:31.292
You can keep your invite.
I'm not going.


01:38:37.834 --> 01:38:43.834
This film is dedicated to
the real Shiny Shrimps.

